            "type": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "The classification codes represents function of health care (HC), source of funding (HF), provider industry (HP) and capital formation (HK).\r\n\r\nThe services of rehabilative care (HC.2) can not be separated from the services of curative care (HC.1) in the Swedish health accounts, so they are reported together. These groups are also reported together in the data sent to OECD/Eurostat/WHO.  Some figures in the group out-patient curative care (HC.1.3) are reported separately, but do observe that there are also figures for rehabilative care included in these figures.",
        "The figures for 2024 are based on preliminary annual estimations of the national accounts."
      ],
